WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
I owe more than three thousand

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:05,380
People came to the door asking for five thousand dollars.

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,700
Then give me three thousand first

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:12,060
Not five thousand five hundred, more or less five hundred

5
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:18,430
I didn't have to worry about anything before

6
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:20,230
There’s still 4,000 a month in rent.

7
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:22,960
Now people come and go every day

8
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,640
It took me a long time to earn five hundred

9
00:00:25,730 --> 00:00:26,810
At first I proposed

10
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:28,010
You yourself agreed

11
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:30,970
I did it because you said you can make money, brother

12
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:32,210
Do you want to take a picture?

13
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:34,730
What's the point of shooting in a frame? Take a handful of melon seeds.

14
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:35,690
Stand at someone's door and watch
